<section class="custom-container-block align wp-block-acf-container" id="block_e89ca5fbb811d0f1ceef2b64a748ad0a">
    <div class="flex-container d-flex flex-column gap-4">
        <div class="acf-innerblocks-container">

<h2 id="h-at-lake-land-college-you-re-more-than-a-student" class="wp-block-heading"><strong>AT LAKE LAND COLLEGE, YOU&#8217;RE MORE THAN A STUDENT.</strong></h2>



<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<p class="callout-styling wp-block-paragraph">You&#8217;re part of a community dedicated to your success.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We know that education should be <strong>accessible and affordable</strong> for everyone. That&#8217;s why we&#8217;ve created a welcoming community that&#8217;s all about diverse needs and backgrounds. Whether you&#8217;re going straight into the job market, planning to attend a four-year school, or dreaming of starting your own business, <strong>Lake Land College is here for you</strong>.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">With our top-ranked programs and award-winning faculty, you&#8217;ll get hands-on training and real-world experiences to <strong>jumpstart your career, learn new skills, or advance in your job.</strong></p>



<div class="wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="/apply">JOIN US AT LAKE LAND COLLEGE</a></div>
</div>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<figure class="wp-block-image size-large is-resized"><img data-dominant-color="898385" data-has-transparency="false" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="1024" height="683" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/computer-lab-2-1024x683.webp" alt="" class="wp-image-162 not-transparent" style="--dominant-color: #898385; width:582px;height:auto" srcset="https://www.lakelandcollege.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/computer-lab-2-1024x683.webp 1024w, https://www.lakelandcollege.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/computer-lab-2-300x200.webp 300w, https://www.lakelandcollege.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/computer-lab-2-768x512.webp 768w, https://www.lakelandcollege.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/computer-lab-2-1536x1024.webp 1536w, https://www.lakelandcollege.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/computer-lab-2-jpg.webp 2048w" /></figure>
</div>
</div>

