            padding: 2rem;
        }
    }
</style>

<section class="slick-carousel align wp-block-lakeland-accordion">
    <div class="slick-carousel-container">
                                <div class="carousel-slide">
                <div class="carousel-slide-container">
                    <div class="carousel-slide_image" style="--background-image: url('https://www.lakelandcollege.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Miller-Brandon-SP-26.webp')"></div>
                    <div class="carousel-slide_content">
                        <div class="carousel-slide_body"><p>“There are more career opportunities here at Lake Land than you find in other places, but there’s also so many life skills to be gained here.”</p>
</div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide_name">Brandon Miller</div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide_title">&#8217;97, Construction &amp; Trades</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
                                <div class="carousel-slide">
                <div class="carousel-slide-container">
                    <div class="carousel-slide_image" style="--background-image: url('https://www.lakelandcollege.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Birch-Savannah-SP-26.webp')"></div>
                    <div class="carousel-slide_content">
                        <div class="carousel-slide_body"><p>“Sometimes every step feels unattainable, but it’s not. You just keep going after your dream and somehow it works out.”</p>
</div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide_name">Savannah Birch</div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide_title">&#8217;18, Pre-Veterinary</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
                                <div class="carousel-slide">
                <div class="carousel-slide-container">
                    <div class="carousel-slide_image" style="--background-image: url('https://www.lakelandcollege.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Hunt-Hannah-SP-26.webp')"></div>
                    <div class="carousel-slide_content">
                        <div class="carousel-slide_body"><p>“I get to see my hard work pay off every day. I get to watch these kids as they gain independence and start to discover where they’re going.”</p>
</div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide_name">Hannah Hunt</div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide_title">&#8217;22, Education</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
                                <div class="carousel-slide">
                <div class="carousel-slide-container">
                    <div class="carousel-slide_image" style="--background-image: url('https://www.lakelandcollege.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Yoder-Cassie-FA-25-Alumni.webp')"></div>
                    <div class="carousel-slide_content">
                        <div class="carousel-slide_body"><p>“If you don’t know what you want to do, Lake Land is the best step to sort through your career options and if you do know what you want to do, Lake Land is an option that lets you dive into that industry right away.”</p>
</div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide_name">Cassie Yoder</div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide_title">&#8217;04, Broadcasting</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
                                <div class="carousel-slide">
                <div class="carousel-slide-container">
                    <div class="carousel-slide_image" style="--background-image: url('https://www.lakelandcollege.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/May-Jennifer-SP-26.webp')"></div>
                    <div class="carousel-slide_content">
                        <div class="carousel-slide_body"><p>“Some people think that it’s too late for people like us to go to school, but time has only prepared us more to know what we want in life. It’s never too late to follow your dreams.”</p>
</div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide_name">Jennifer May</div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide_title">&#8217;25, Human Services</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
                                <div class="carousel-slide">
                <div class="carousel-slide-container">
                    <div class="carousel-slide_image" style="--background-image: url('https://www.lakelandcollege.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Housh-Sarah-SP-26.webp')"></div>
                    <div class="carousel-slide_content">
                        <div class="carousel-slide_body"><p>“It’s easy to take for granted everything I’m doing now, but you can’t fully appreciate the present until you look back at where you came from.”</p>
</div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide_name">Sarah Housh</div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide_title">&#8217;26, Liberal Arts</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
                                <div class="carousel-slide">
                <div class="carousel-slide-container">
                    <div class="carousel-slide_image" style="--background-image: url('https://www.lakelandcollege.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Garza-Jade-FA-25.webp')"></div>
                    <div class="carousel-slide_content">
                        <div class="carousel-slide_body"><p>“You meet a lot of helpful people at Lake Land who can help you through the right path. I think if anybody follows their dreams, they can make it happen.”</p>
</div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide_name">Jade Garza</div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide_title">&#8217;26, Human Services</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
                                <div class="carousel-slide">
                <div class="carousel-slide-container">
                    <div class="carousel-slide_image" style="--background-image: url('https://www.lakelandcollege.edu/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Rolando-Monte-de-Oca-Spring-24-1-scaled.webp')"></div>
                    <div class="carousel-slide_content">
                        <div class="carousel-slide_body"><div class="carousel-slide_body">
<p>“Becoming a nurse at Lake Land is the same level of intensity when you’re done as you’re going to get anywhere else&#8230; the biggest difference here is the price. You don’t get what you pay for here. You get more.”</p>
</div>
</div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide_name">Rolando Monte de Oca</div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide_title">’24, Nursing</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
                                <div class="carousel-slide">
                <div class="carousel-slide-container">
                    <div class="carousel-slide_image" style="--background-image: url('https://www.lakelandcollege.edu/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Noella-Kasera-Spring-24-scaled.webp')"></div>
                    <div class="carousel-slide_content">
                        <div class="carousel-slide_body"><div class="carousel-slide_body">
<p>“Lake Land offers benefits that I don’t hear about other schools offering… they understand that this is different to me, and they try to make me feel at home.”</p>
</div>
</div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide_name">Noella Kasera</div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide_title">‘25, Criminal Justice</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
                                <div class="carousel-slide">
                <div class="carousel-slide-container">
                    <div class="carousel-slide_image" style="--background-image: url('https://www.lakelandcollege.edu/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Todd-Walker-Spring-23-scaled.webp')"></div>
                    <div class="carousel-slide_content">
                        <div class="carousel-slide_body"><p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>“Lake Land has continuously exceeded my expectations for what I thought they would have to offer. Getting started everyone was super helpful in making things seamless and easier.&#8221;</p>
</div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide_name">Todd Walker</div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide_title">’24, Automotive Technology</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
                                <div class="carousel-slide">
                <div class="carousel-slide-container">
                    <div class="carousel-slide_image" style="--background-image: url('https://www.lakelandcollege.edu/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Tanner-Mickey-Spring-24-scaled.webp')"></div>
                    <div class="carousel-slide_content">
                        <div class="carousel-slide_body"><div class="carousel-slide_body">
<p>“I would describe Lake Land as a tightknit family. You know everybody here, and you get to have one-on-one relationships with your instructors. Transferring was the easiest process you could ever think of.”</p>
</div>
</div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide_name">Tanner Mickey</div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide_title">’22, Agriculture Transfer – University of Illinois</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
                                <div class="carousel-slide">
                <div class="carousel-slide-container">
                    <div class="carousel-slide_image" style="--background-image: url('https://www.lakelandcollege.edu/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Lydia-Madlem-Spring-23-scaled-e1751915536549.webp')"></div>
                    <div class="carousel-slide_content">
                        <div class="carousel-slide_body"><div class="carousel-slide_body">
<p>“The instructors are fantastic and they are constantly helping me build and improve my skills.”</p>
</div>
</div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide_name">Lydia Madlem</div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide_title">’23, Court Reporting and Captioning</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
                                <div class="carousel-slide">
                <div class="carousel-slide-container">
                    <div class="carousel-slide_image" style="--background-image: url('https://www.lakelandcollege.edu/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Boyd-Turnbow-Fall-24.webp')"></div>
                    <div class="carousel-slide_content">
                        <div class="carousel-slide_body"><div class="carousel-slide_body">
<p>“Graduating from Lake Land was like the start of a whole new life.  I had written myself off as someone who’d be stuck in a factory and now I was walking straight into a job I knew I’d love.”</p>
</div>
</div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide_name">Boyd Turnbow</div>
                        <div class="carousel-slide_title">’22, GED &amp; Associate in IT Network Administration</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            </div>
</section>


